        "input": "3\n3\n2 3 1\n3\n1 2 2\n5\n4 2 3 57 10",
        "output": "1\n0\n24",
        "explanation": "Explanation:\nTest Case 1 : Choose i=3i = 3i=3, and multiply by 222. We get [2,2,3][2, 2, 3][2,2,3] which has max⁡(A)−min⁡(A)=1\\max(A) - \\min(A) = 1max(A)−min(A)=1.\nTest Case 2 : Choose i=1i = 1i=1, and multiply by 222. We get [2,2,2][2, 2, 2][2,2,2] which has max⁡(A)−min⁡(A)=0\\max(A) - \\min(A) = 0max(A)−min(A)=0."
      }
